This is the bear essentials to learn when working in python3, it helps understand not only the terminology but also the layout, thinking and work that go into the code.

## What it does
- Feature one
useful files for basics
- Feature two
learn how to write the basics

## Running it

    git clone github.com:thomaslongworth2000-rgb/terminal-toolkit.git
    cd project
    python3 -m venv .venv
    source .venv/bin/activate
    pip install -r requirements.txt
    python3 main.py

